# Every commit on a dev/* branch bumps the patch (pre-commit hook), so the version
# differs whenever two branches meet: BOS merges it (the higher wins, the rest merges
# as usual). The driver is registered by `task hooks:merge-driver` (every pre-commit)
# and by the workflows' merges; without it git merges these files as text.
package.json merge=bos-version
package-lock.json merge=bos-version
